# Redesign Services Carousel

The goal is to elevate the "Services" carousel (infinite scroll) on the home page to a more premium and interactive experience, following the established design language.

## Proposed Changes

### [MODIFY] [Services.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/landing-siprac/landing-siprac/siprac-website/components/sections/Services.tsx)

- **Card Evolution**: 
    - Replace FontAwesome icons with more refined **Lucide React** icons.
    - Implement a "Glassmorphism" footer or header within the card.
    - Add a subtle background watermark or pattern to each card.
    - Improve the typography hierarchy using `font-black` for titles and refined weights for lists.
- **Carousel Enhancements**:
    - Add a "pause on hover" functionality.
    - Improve the edge gradients for a more "seamless" look on large screens.
    - Add a hover effect that slightly expands the card and brightens the icon.
- **Section Styling**:
    - Add subtle background decorative elements (blobs or mesh) to the section background.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run build` to ensure all new icons and components are correctly imported and typed.

### Manual Verification
- Verify the carousel animation is smooth on different screen sizes.
- Ensure the "pause on hover" works as expected.
- Visual inspection of the card designs.
